WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Luke dashes while Ryu rises from the prerequisite knockdown.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:00.850
Luke backs out of Ryu’s throw range.

3
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.400
Standing heavy punch catches the throw recovery as Punish Counter.

4
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.600
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.500
The light Avenger punch follow-up completes the juggle.

6
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.500
Ryu lands after the Avenger ender.
